    "## 1. My lane (or freestyle) and why\n",
    "\n",
    "Editors don't have time to review thousands of pages. Therefore, Lane 2 builds a ranked review queue with clear reason codes so editors know exactly which high-value pages to be prioritized first."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. The question: decision, action, cost of a wrong call\n",
    "\n",
    "### Research Question\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "* **Unit of Analysis:** A single content item aggregated over a historical performance window.\n",
    "* **The Decision:** Prioritizing the pages for the editors to update.\n",
    "* **The Action:** Updating facts or changing titles and metadata.\n",
    "* **Cost of a Wrong Call:** Wasting editorial time and budget on pages that don't need fixing which can potentially risk break existing rankings.\n",
    "* **Why Data / ML Helps:** ML allows us to combine non-linear decay signals across multiple dimensions and rank candidates by actionable priority."
   ]
  },
