    "## 4. Careful words: what I can and can't claim\n",
    "\n",
    "### What I CAN Claim:\n",
    "* This system identifies and ranks pages exhibiting observable, historical signals of performance decay.\n",
    "* The model produces a decision-support review queue that prioritizes where editorial capacity is most urgently needed.\n",
    "* Precision metrics (e.g., Precision@50) demonstrate whether learned rankings outperform fixed rule-based heuristics.\n",
    "\n",
    "### What I CANNOT Claim:\n",
    "* Causal proof that a page dropped *because* of a specific factor (e.g., proving Google core algorithm updates).\n",
    "* Guaranteed traffic recovery or revenue gains simply because a flagged page is edited.\n",
    "* Complete immunity from site-wide seasonality or competitor strategy shifts without controlled A/B testing."
